\pm 4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow that we have the values of $t,$ we proceed to find $x$ and $y.$ \n\n- We start with $t=-4.$ For $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =4t \\\\  & =4(-4) \\\\  & =-16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{32}{t} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{(-4)} \\\\  & =-8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the coordinates of the first intersection point are $(-16,-8).$\n\n- We now move over to $t=4.$ For $x,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =4t \\\\  & =4(4) \\\\  & =16.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFor $y,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{32}{t} \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{4} \\\\  & =8.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the coordinates of the second intersection point are $(16,8).$\n\nTherefore, the curve $x=4t,\\,y=\\frac{32}{t}$ intersects the line $\\frac{1}{2}x-y=0$ at the points $(-16,-8)$ and $(16,8).$" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342141 13194139535291 true] [17592186342140 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342142 13194139535291 true] [17592186342140 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535291 true] [17592186342140 1041 "field-1" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342140 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342141 13194139535291 true] [17592186342140 1110 #uuid "f787ab61-7e81-5e51-9a54-ae6936d25143" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342141 1034 "-8" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342141 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535291 true] [17592186342141 1111 #uuid "3ba4e6fa-0533-5f8f-9e17-ed9ac11a4680" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342142 1034 "8" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342142 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535291 true] [17592186342142 1111 #uuid "23534205-d925-581b-819c-0b3a63a2bae8" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342143 1000 #edb/ref 17592186342144 13194139535291 true] [17592186342143 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535291 true] [17592186342143 1041 "field-2" 13194139535291 true] [17592186342143 1104 #edb/ref 17592186342144 13194139535291 true] [17592186342143 1110 #uuid "d583b822-be47-50ee-bddf-8202fc4166d5" 131941395352